Blank canvas to a working Flux 2 Klein image edit workflow — 17 nodes, every single one explained. This workflow takes two reference photos (your character + a product, outfit, or scene) and combines them into one new image with a single prompt. No masks, no inpainting, no LoRA training. By the end you won't just have the workflow, you'll understand why every node is there.

